2026-08-17 15:41:25,580 1578042 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'goal', 'text': '`find . -maxdepth 3 -name CLAUDE.md` in `mt-alarm-1` returned nothing. Every arriving\nsession rediscovers that this is a superrepo of four independent git repos, which ports\nare taken, and where a finding goes. This session did exactly that, and the handover it\ninherited did not know it either.\n\n**Scope decided before writing.** A `CLAUDE.md` at the superrepo root is read by\nsessions in `bridge/`, `plugins/` and `device/` as well, because Claude reads upward\nfrom the cwd — and those are separate repos with their own owners. So the file is\n**descriptive about the siblings and directive only about `html/`**. It records their\nmeasured branch, HEAD, check and count, and states that each component owns its own\nconventions. Reversal: `rm CLAUDE.md`.\n\nDone 2026-08-17, commit a53ad4b.'}
