2026-08-18 13:08:23,271 1578042 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'plan', 'text': "Per `docs/spec/command-card.md` (attached).\n\n1. `formCard()` + `onSubmit()` in `cards.js` — the module's last missing card type.\n2. The command panel in `app.js`: units from `ws /state`, verbs from `GET /schema`,\n   submit to `POST /queue`, and a session ledger with four distinct states.\n3. Narrow the fetch guard from a ban to a target allowlist.\n4. Falsify the guard; verify in a real browser.\n\n**Done 2026-08-18, commit `1ea79e1`.** 35/35. Verified at 1600×1000: no page scroll,\nsix panels, zero clipped bodies, devices populated, and the card reporting the exact\nblocker rather than pretending.\n\n**It does not work yet and that is expected** — `page-cannot-post-to-the-bridge` is open\nwith bridge as #12. Built on Peter's instruction to assume it will be fixed.\n\nThree of my own defects found in Phase 4: the wiring never landed (an edit replaced the\nwrong `route();`), six panels broke the one-viewport rule and clipped both device\nbodies, and a clipped body was invisible to my own check because the panel hides\noverflow."}
