2026-08-19 08:00:54,182 1774009 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_new args={'name': 'schema-hash-blinded-the-bridge', 'title': 'BUG a labels-only schema edit stopped the bridge decoding both units, and five things that should have caught it did not', 'steps': ['BUG the schema hash is taken over the whole file, so editing a label brands every deployed unit as incompatible', 'BUG append-only is only backward compatible until the field count crosses a multiple of 8, because the bitmap width is not on the wire', 'BUG settleByAns cannot fire when obs will not decode, so the bridge retransmitted a command it had evidence had already run', 'GAP rxid says the unit has the command and nothing reads it, so a confirmed delivery still retransmits', 'BUG a Meshtastic telemetry frame counts as a beat, so the bridge reported GARG healthy while unable to decode a word it said', 'GAP a queued command records no caller, so a reboot of a deployed unit is unattributable', 'BUG reply is purged after 7 days while queue and send are kept forever, so the audit trail rots into unanswered stubs', 'BUG retention keeps unlisted kinds only by omission, so adding a policy row would silently start deleting audit history', 'GAP 56 decode failures were logged and nothing alerted, so the outage was found by a human noticing a missing reply', 'BUG /schema declares 200 and 400 for POST /queue but the code returns 202, 404 and 409', 'TOOL round-trip must work against a deployed unit, where hop 4 is unobservable by construction rather than skipped', 'VERIFY send a ping to GARG and track every hop with the new tool']}
