2026-08-19 09:39:13,607 1774009 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_new args={'name': 'bridge-backlog', 'title': 'STANDING REGISTER of open bridge work — one step per item, worked one at a time, never closed as a whole', 'steps': ['BUG rxid says the unit has the command and nothing reads it, so a confirmed delivery still retransmits', 'BUG a Meshtastic telemetry frame counts as a beat, so contact.overdue can read healthy while nothing decodes', 'GAP a queued command records no caller, so the 2026-08-13 reboot of a deployed unit is unattributable', 'GAP nothing alerts on a decode failure, which is why device could not see an eight-hour outage they went looking for', 'BUG inFlight never returns to zero after a giveup, because dequeue does not clear the pending POST', 'BUG restore moves link.heardAt BACKWARDS and contact.overdue is computed off it, so a restart manufactures a false overdue', 'MEASURE the rotator azimuth is not recorded at frame arrival, so a weak sighting cannot be told from a mispointed aerial', 'BUG a restart silently discards the queue, so a command answered 202 vanishes with no cancel and no giveup', 'GAP round-trip cannot tell that the bridge restarted under it, so a void run reports as a timeout', 'GAP round-trip still ignores measured.landing, comms.lastRx, comms.answering, direct-vs-relayed and six event kinds', 'DECIDE with device: hash the wire projection instead of the file, both sides in one step', 'AGREE close queue-schema-declares-the-wrong-codes once html confirms the corrected document', 'AGREE chase plugins on replay-delivers-replies-twice, open since 2026-08-18', 'DECIDE BNCH is still on the 60s beat set during testing - restore 900s or keep it', 'DISCUSS raise with device that must did not re-clamp when the beat changed, despite clampMustSend', 'VERIFY neither unit has a working debug console, so round-trip hop 4 is permanently unobservable', 'TIDY probe.undefined is a kind name, and almost certainly a plugin bug rather than a real kind']