2026-08-19 10:40:46,239 1797750 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'plan', 'text': 'Spec: docs/specs/one-idiot-skill-on-this-repo.md\n\n1. mv idiot-0 and idiot-p to ~/.claude/skills/.off/ — the loader scans skills/*/SKILL.md so one level deeper is invisible, and .off has no SKILL.md of its own. Moved not deleted: /idiot-p carries the proof-first argument the new /idiot inherits.\n2. Rewrite ~/.claude/skills/idiot/SKILL.md so the ledger is <git-toplevel>/idiot.yaml and the tool is `idiot`. EVERY command copied from `idiot <verb> -h`, never from either existing document — both are stale (they document `raise` and `--id`, neither of which exists; argparse refuses --id on all nine verbs).\n3. Replace each specboard reference with its register equivalent rather than deleting it: defects/raise -> idiot add; found/accepted/fixed typed by hand -> verdicts derived from what the test did; fixed-takes-a-SHA -> prove re-runs the recorded test and closure prints its rung; "pay the debt" prose -> the hook refusing edits to an untried entry\'s files. GET /resources has no replacement — say so rather than invent one.\n4. Falsify by RUNNING every command block in the new file and pasting the output. A command that errors is the defect, since that is exactly how both existing documents got into this state. Then grep -ric specboard on it must be 0, and the listing must show one idiot.\n\nBake in what this session learnt the hard way: run the check standalone before `idiot try` (an unknown id exits 127 = mistrial, and that produced a false conviction on day one); the capture must name the measurement, not merely exit non-zero; amend BEFORE trying; and the order that actually works is edit -> amend -> try -> edit -> prove, because amend returns the entry to untried which locks its own files.\n\nOUT OF SCOPE, reported not fixed: settings.json runs the specboard hook on three events (PreToolUse, SessionStart, Stop) and the repo still exists; /verify is a specboard skill by definition; idiot.py\'s own module docstring is stale in the same way and needs its own entry and its own red.'}
