2026-08-20 13:45:26,903 2053659 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'note', 'text': 'Peter, 2026-08-20, verbatim — the DECIDE step, answered:\n\n  "yes must be "@xxxx" only, everything else ignored, and you also need to reply to my\n   message saying queued or other status if needed."\n\nSo: the `@token` prefix is the ONLY admitted form — there is no defaultUnit and no bare\ncommand. Anything else heard on the private channel is ignored silently. And the relay\nDOES answer over the mesh, which means a second transport (POST to mesh-gw), threaded\nwith reply_id to his message.\n\nHis original request, read off the mesh-gw feed 2026-08-20 (id 1915615722, from_num\n3663393832, channel_role private):\n\n  "Can you add the ability so that If i send a ping from this device  it get relayed/ queued ?"\n'}
