2026-08-22 17:10:58,771 2586895 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'plan', 'text': 'Serve the index from the HOST, not from each plugin. Two mechanisms, tried and closed separately because they fail for different reasons:\n\n1. a-router-less-plugin-answers-its-bare-path-with-a-claim-about-a-device — plugins/packets returns None from setup(), so mount_plugin_router never runs for it and the core catch-all /{node_id}/packets answered 404 "Unknown device: plugins". mount_plugin_indexes now iterates host.loaded, never host.routers.\n\n2. the-no-slash-form-of-a-plugin-path-is-eaten-by-a-core-route-with-the-same-second-segment — a plugin\'s own GET / covers only the trailing-slash form; /plugins/nodes and /plugins/traceroute were taken by GET /{node_id}/nodes and POST /{node_id}/traceroute. The host mounts the 307 Starlette would have issued, in front of the catch-alls.\n\nA plugin that answers for itself keeps its own body — asserted as a control, so a uniform host stub cannot silently delete what aim and nodes publish.'}
