2026-08-22 17:36:15,085 2593086 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'goal', 'text': 'Peter, 2026-08-22: "can you remove the mcpp-roadmap from mcpp\'s tools". Retires roadmap_all, roadmap_next, roadmap_focus, roadmap_areas_init, roadmap_areas_set and roadmap_areas_check. It also SHUTS THE DELETION WINDOW I had been flagging: roadmap.py:57 imports claude/areas, so while those tools were registered, deleting that module would have made all six fail on import. Unregistered first, claude/areas can now go without breaking anything.'}
