2026-08-22 19:09:50,533 2604716 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_area_describe args={'name': 'command', 'description': "**product · priority 1** — A command from accepted to settled.\n\nQueue it, hand it to storeward or fire it ourselves, correlate the reply, end it in exactly one terminal state. Scope is `src/bridge.js` alone — **the composition root gets its own area**, because giving it to a feature area makes that area look foundational and makes every finding straddle two. Nearly every other area *watches* this file.\n\nAbsorbs what flow's list calls **queue** and **lifecycle**: at path level they are the same file and cannot be separated by a glob.\n\n**TWO LIVE DEFECTS:**\n- At `maxQueued` 1 (`:255`) an unsettled row refuses every new command to that unit, and `claimFromStoreward()` (`:2241`) only runs on an incoming reply (`:1922`) — so a fired-but-unanswered command blocks its unit for ever. All three units blocked since 2026-08-22 12:04Z.\n- `/commands/lifecycle` publishes 10 states; the bridge emits 12 — `held` (`:2338`) and `contradicted` (`:872`) are unpublished, and a command has been seen leaving `answered`, which is declared terminal."}
